# .dockerignore – Drowsiness Detection
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Excludes files from the Docker build context to keep the image lean and
# avoid leaking sensitive data or large unnecessary files.

# ── Git & IDE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.vscode

# ── Python cache ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# ── Logs (mounted as a volume at runtime) ────────────────────────────────────
logs/

# ── Employee DB (mounted as a volume at runtime) ──────────────────────────────
employee/

# ── Test / development artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────
test/
test.jpg
drowsiness_images/
compare.py

# ── Docker files (no need to recurse into themselves) ────────────────────────
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore

# ── Misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md
*.csv
README.md
